# #725: the local entry-point supertool's own SessionStart hook creates at
# the repo root -- git-ignored here (tracked) rather than only in this one
# machine's local .git/info/exclude, so a pull request cannot ship a
# TRACKED file at this path and have git overwrite the ignored entry-point
# on checkout.
